          "content": {
            "size": 6419,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 3763,
            "text": "{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"{{HEX_ID}}\",\"type\":\"dataset\",\"attributes\":{\"errors\":[],\"access\":\"public\",\"additionalResources\":[],\"collection\":[\"Document\"],\"categories\":[],\"commentsEnabled\":false,\"composeStatus\":{\"retries\":0,\"lastSuccessAt\":1755332381239,\"pass\":true,\"lastRetriedAt\":1755332381240},\"composedAt\":1755332381214,\"content\":\"Hub Page\",\"created\":1694560360000,\"description\":null,\"downloadable\":false,\"enrichCoverage\":\"unknown\",\"enrichQuality\":66,\"extent\":null,\"groupIds\":[\"{{HEX_ID}}\"],\"hasApi\":false,\"hubType\":\"Hub Page\",\"id\":\"{{HEX_ID}}\",\"itemId\":\"{{HEX_ID}}\",\"itemModified\":1743503095000,\"itemExtent\":[],\"layer\":null,\"layers\":null,\"licenseInfo\":null,\"metadata\":null,\"modified\":1743503095000,\"modifiedProvenance\":\"item.modified\",\"name\":\"FAQs\",\"openData\":false,\"orgId\":\"dQsP3byyKkTT53Ep\",\"orgName\":\"HSE-HPSC\",\"organization\":\"HSE-HPSC\",\"orgExtent\":{\"ymin\":2700000,\"xmin\":-15000000,\"ymax\":6500000,\"xmax\":-6200000,\"spatialReference\":{\"wkid\":102100}},\"owner\":\"ID_HubAdmin\",\"region\":\"IE\",\"searchDescription\":\"General FAQs About\\n        the Notifiable Disease Hub What\\n        is the National Notifiable Disease Hub for Ireland? The hub is a collection of dashboards displaying data on trends and key epidemiological features for notifiable\\n    infectious diseases reported in Ireland. How\\n        was the National Notifiable Disease Hub developed? The hub offers users trend analysis and other key epidemiological features not previously available in HPSC's weekly infectious disease reports. The hub improves the readability of data for users, creates efficiencies by dynamically displaying data, and gives users access to underlying aggregate data. The hub includes features such as statistical measures to compare the current week's data with comparable data from earlier time periods, and filtering capacity to display data by disease group e.g. respiratory diseases, vaccine-preventable diseases. The National Notifiable Disease Hub has come about through a collaboration between HPSC and People and Place Ltd.  The hub was developed using ArcGIS, which is a data visualisation tool. ArcGIS has allowed us to create a dynamic set of visualisations for notifiable infectious disease data in Ireland using reproducible workflows to ensure consistent and timely dissemination to our stakeholders. How often is the National Notifiable Disease Hub updated? The hub is updated weekly on Wednesday afternoons and includes data up to the previous Saturday night (end of the notification week). Who manages the National Notifiable Disease Hub? The hub is managed by the HSE Health Protection Surveillance Centre (HPSC).  For more information about HPSC visit HPSC. What population denominators are used? Census 2016 is used for years up to and including 2019 and Census 2022 for years 2020 onwards. What years of data are featured on the National Notifiable Disease Hub? Data includes CIDR notifications over a rolling five-year period up to the current week number for the current year. What caveats are there regarding interpreting the data? Data are provisional and subject to ongoing review, validation and updating. As a result, weekly data may vary from previously published data. The capture of notification case data is subject to a variety of administrative and case definition changes over time. Other possible issues which may affect interpretation of the data include late notifications and batch upload of notifications from laboratories. The data presented in the hub should be interpreted with these caveats in mind. The following downloadable file presents a summary of footnotes in relation to the data. Useful Links User Guide Download the National Notifiable Disease Hub User Guide Provides an overview of Hub contents and functionality Download User Guide Downloading Data Direct Dashboard Download Data on the National Notifiable Disease Hub What data are included in the National Notifiable Disease Hub? The table below summarises the measures and dimensions presented in the National Notifiable Disease Hub. Currently, 80 of the 89 notifiable diseases as specified under the Infectious Diseases (Amendment)   Regulations 2022 (S.I. No. 258 of 2022) are reported on CIDR. The hub displays data on all 80   notifiable infectious diseases that are recorded on the CIDR system. Note: No data are presented in   the Hub for diseases without new cases in the last five years.\",\"server\":null,\"size\":2059015,\"slug\":\"hpscireland::faqs\",\"source\":\"HSE-HPSC\",\"sourceProvenance\":\"org.name\",\"structuredLicense\":{\"type\":\"none\"},\"license\":\"none\",\"tags\":[\"\"],\"thumbnail\":\"thumbnail/ago_downloaded.png\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"thumbnail/ago_downloaded.png\",\"type\":\"Hub Page\",\"typeCategories\":[\"Document\"],\"typeKeywords\":[\"Hub\",\"hubPage\",\"JavaScript\",\"Map\",\"Mapping Site\",\"Online Map\",\"OpenData\",\"selfConfigured\",\"Web Map\"],\"validExtent\":true,\"boundary\":null,\"snippet\":null,\"culture\":\"en-us\"},\"links\":{\"self\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/datasets/{{HEX_ID}}\",\"rawEs\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/es/datasets/{{HEX_ID}}\",\"itemPage\":\"https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id={{HEX_ID}}\",\"esriRest\":\"https://www.arcgis.com/sharing/content/items/{{HEX_ID}}?f=json\"},\"meta\":{\"highlights\":{},\"matchedFields\":[]}}],\"meta\":{\"apiRoot\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/\",\"queryParameters\":{\"filter\":{\"id\":\"{{HEX_ID}}\",\"isCancelled\":\"eventsEq(false)\",\"status\":\"not(private,draft,planned)\",\"endDate\":\"eventsBefore(1755347314338)\"},\"page\":{\"size\":\"1\",\"number\":1}},\"request\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/datasets?filter%5Bid%5D={{HEX_ID}}&page%5Bsize%5D=1\",\"resourceRoot\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/datasets\",\"stats\":{\"totalCount\":1,\"count\":1,\"aggs\":{}},\"page\":{\"start\":1,\"size\":1,\"nextStart\":-1},\"took\":10,\"total\":1,\"datasetsMatching\":{\"onlySemanticFields\":[],\"onlyNonSemanticFields\":[],\"both\":[]}},\"links\":{\"first\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/datasets?filter%5Bid%5D={{HEX_ID}}&page%5Bsize%5D=1&page%5Bnumber%5D=1\",\"next\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/datasets?filter%5Bid%5D={{HEX_ID}}&page%5Bsize%5D=1&page%5Bnumber%5D=2\",\"last\":\"https://hub.arcgis.com/api/v3/datasets?filter%5Bid%5D={{HEX_ID}}&page%5Bsize%5D=1&page%5Bnumber%5D=2\"}}"
